# ADR-edit waiver sentinel — template-maintenance opt-out for the accepted-ADR
# immutability guard (scripts/hooks/guard-protected-files.mjs). NEVER commit it: a
# committed sentinel would ship the guard disabled. Drop it locally to edit an accepted
# ADR in place, remove it when done.
.adr-edit-waiver
